---
// How It Works Section
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="how-it-works section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      A simple workflow for guides to prepare, share and report on tours.
    </p>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">1️⃣</div>
        <h3>Create Tour</h3>
        <p>
          Guides prepare reusable tour templates and invite participants through link, QR code or email.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">2️⃣</div>
        <h3>Share Observations</h3>
        <p>
          During the tour, guides record species, notes, photos, time and location. Participants see updates live.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">3️⃣</div>
        <h3>Generate Reports</h3>
        <p>
          After the tour, FollowBirds creates a shareable web and PDF report automatically with all observations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="how-it-works-cta">
      <a href="#tour-report" class="btn btn-secondary">See Example Report</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-it-works {
    background-color: #fff;
  }

  .how-it-works h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #5E6B60;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid #E8DFD3;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .card:hover {
    border-color: #2F7D32;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(47, 125, 50, 0.08);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .card h3 {
    color: #142016;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card p {
    color: #5E6B60;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .how-it-works-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
